		(property "Description" "Side-strip NeoPixel pixel (WS2812B-compatible 5050; SK6812 has the same footprint but a different pinout, so check the symbol before swapping). 6 pixels in a vertical line, about 42 mm. DIN of the first pixel comes from GP9 via R10. No per-pixel bypass capacitor (user decision 2026-10-01; datasheet recommends 0.1uF each). DIN high level >=0.7*VDD (3.5V) is marginal at 3.3V; verify on the real part. Cap brightness in firmware."
			(at 53.34 179.07 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
